<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">-Totela Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">MAKOLINTE</para>
  <para style="toc1">IN’OLO LYABILI LYA PAULUSI KU MAKOLINTE</para>
  <para style="toc2">2Makolinte</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Makoli</para>
  <para style="mt2">IN’OLO LYABILI LYA PAULUSI KU</para>
  <para style="mt1">2 MAKOLINTE</para>
  <para style="imt">INZIBAAZO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Nime Paulusi, mutumigwa gwa Jesu Kilesite ko mugajalo gwa Nyambe, ime na mukwangu Timoteya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Nasa n’olela inkeleke ja Nyambe iji jikele mwa Kolinte, ne ku bantu bonse bo kucena ba Nyambe aba bakele mu munzi gonse gwa Akaya.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Muwegwe inkumbu no nkozo jizwa kwe Setu Nyambe na ku Mfumu Jesu Kilesite.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulusi aa awa amalumbo ku Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Amalumbo gabe kwa Nyambe na Tata gwa Mfumwetu Jesu Kilesite, Tata go cisemo no Nyambe go kugongoza konse, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />uju atugongoza mu mapenzi getu gonse, mane tula gola ukugongoza aba bakele mu mapenzi, ko kugongozwa iswe uku natwa tambula kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Mi sinagwe ubu tuli taangila ubungi bo mapenzi ga Kilesite, cwale no kugongozwa kwetu mwa Kilesite kukele. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Mi ati natu pengisigwa, muku gongozigwa kwenu no kujojisigwa, mi ati natu gongozigwa, nenwe mu gongozigwe kwenu, uku kuleta ukugombaala mu aa mugola uku ligongoza mu makababu genu, go kukoza sinagwe amapenzi aga tu shugwisigwa neswe. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Mi insepo jetu kwenu jili gongwele, ukuti tuli zekelele buti nenwe mwasa litaangila mu mapenzi getu, sinagwe ubu muli taangila mu kugongozigwa kwetu.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Cwale bakwangu, tani shaki buti muleke uku zekelela byo mapenzi aga naga tukezela mu cilalanda ca Asiya, imizigo iji naba tukolekisa kajili minene no kulema lwini, mi kale twa maninwa insepo jo kujoja. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Mi natwa shugwa buti natwa tambula inkatulo jo lufwu. Kono ceci naca tendaala buti tuleke ukulisepa twebeni kono tusepe Nyambe, uju ga busa abafwu. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Mi naga tu ambusa ku lufwu ulumangoju, mi kame kuti natu jojese. Cwale natwa zendeka insepo jetu kwakwe buti kuti natu jojese kame. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Cwale nenwe muli jelele uku tu tusa mu nkumbilo, buti mane abangi kuti na bawe amalumbo, kebaka lyetu ko mfwijaguzi iji natwa wegwa muku taba amakumbilo go bangi.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulusi aa zola imigajalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Mi twasa litunta ukuti ko bumpaki natwa tenda buti natwa jenda mwilonga, buti mane natwa joja nenja nenwe, ko bumi bucenete ubu tabukwesi inkani, ubu buzwa kwa Nyambe, isini ko nzunu jo bantu, kono ko nkumbo ja Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Ukuti tatugoli uku min’olela ibintu tamugola ukubala no kushugwisisa. Mi nila sepa bobo, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />sinagwe aa muzelele mutuito tumwinya, kuti namu shugwisise wawa buti ici namu litunte kaco niswe, sinagwe iswe aa tulitunta kenu mwi juba lyo Mfumu Jesu.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Ukuti kani kwesi insepo, kani shaka uku mipotela tanzila buti na mugwane kobile. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Mi kani shaka uku mipotela nanili mu lujendo lwangu lo kuja kwa Masedoniya, kame nani mi bogwele nani zwa kwa Masedoniya, mi nani gwane intuso jizwa kwenu mu lujendo lwangu lo kuja kwa Judeya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Cwale aa kani gaja bobo, ukuti nana tenda nenja? Kampa nasa tenda imigajalo jangu sinagwe muntu gwe longa, uju agamba “Ee, ee” kampa “Awa, awa” mwi nako jo kulikoza? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Mi sinagwe ni Nyambe uju akwesi intumelo, indagano jetu kwenu tali ja “Ee” na “Awa.” <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Ukuti Mwana Nyambe, Jesu Kilesite, uju naga tatazigwa mukati kenu kwetu, ime ne Silasi no Timoteya natwa tandaza byakwe kwenu, taa kakuli “Ee” na “Awa”, kono kwakwe inako jonse ni Ee <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Ukuti inkuluwizi jonse ja Nyambe ni Ee ka Kilesite. Mi kakwe twasa gamba ‘Ameni’ ko milumbeko ja Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Mi ni Nyambe uju atu gongoza twense ka Kilesite. Naga tushala, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />mi naga tula ulukanko lo kuba bane, mi no kutula Umoya mu myojo jetu go ku gongolekeza ibi bi keza.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Cwale nasa kuga Nyambe ukuba umpaki gwangu, mi nasa tula ubumi bwangu aco. Mi aa nana nangisa kubogola kwa Kolinte kakuli kumi babalela. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Mi tali kuta buti tujendese intumelo jenu, kono tu mituse kwebi bi mi jangaza, ukuti muli gongwele kebaka lyo ntumelo.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Mi nana gaja buti taa nanibe no lujendo lumwinya ulu nalu mikubaze. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Ukuti ati nani mi shugwisa ukushisha, nini a jelele uku ni jangaza? Tali ninwe nila shugwisi ukushisha? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Cwale na nani mi n’olela bobo, buti aa nani keze kwenu nani leke ukugenisigwa kwababo aba bagola ukuni jangaza, ukuti nili jelele uku jangazwa ka babo bantu, nani mi sepite mwense, buti uku jangala kwangu ko ku jangala kwenu mwense. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Ukuti nana mi n’olela nanili mu nkalilwa lwini, umojo gwangu naguli mu bujoge ne minsozi lwini, mi taa kakuli uku mi fwisa inshoni, kono kakuli kumi sunda icisemo ici nimi shaka kaco.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukukwatilwa ko muntu alatendi mulandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Mi ati umuntu jumwinya nala kugenesi, tala nigenesi lwini sinagwe ubu alamigesezi mwense. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Mi kulikele nenja jojo umuntu aa nyansigwa ku bantu bangi. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Cwale bulotu bwa ku mukwatila no kumu sengasenga, mi mu mukwatile aleke ukufwa lwini inshoni. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Cwale nasa mi kumbila, mu muleke a zekelele buti mula mushaka wawa. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Ukuti ceco naca letisa buti nimi n’olele, muku mijeleka no kuzekelela buti muli zundamine ku mandagano gangu gonse. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Mi aa mukwatila umuntu, neme nasa kwatila. Mi ati nanila kwatili umuntu, nila mukwatili ka Kilesite kebaka lyenu, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />buti tuleke ukutapigwa umuntu kwa Satani, ukuti tuli zekelele imigajalo jakwe.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukupenga kwa Paulusi mu Tiloasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Cwale aa nana kaja kwa Tiloasi mu kutandaza Amajwi Amalotu ga Kilesite, mi nana kagwana buti Umfumu naga ni galwila icinzi. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Kono taa kani kwesi inkozo mu nzunu ukuti taa nana kagwana umukwangu Tite. Mi kale naba sigalisa bulyo nani kaja kwa Masedoniya. <verse eid="2CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Kono nasa litumela kwa Nyambe, uju atu jendesa sinagwe bashuminigwa ka Kilesite, mi no kutu litusisa mu kujandulula inzunu jakwe mu bibaka byonse. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Ukuti tuli mununko umulotu gwa Nyambe ka Jesu kwa babo aba bajojesigwa ne babo aba bajunda. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Mi kwakwe tuli mununko ugu guleta ulufwu, mi kwa bamwinya tuli mununko guleta ubumi. Cwale nini a jelele ku musebezi gusika ao. <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Ukuti tatu likozete no bantu abangi, mi tatu vundavundi Amajwi Malotu ga Nyambe mu kuzunda cimwinya, kono ko kusalwisa, mu Kilesite twasa gamba abuso bwa Nyambe natukwesi icote, sinagwe aba naba tumigwa kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Abaika bo busele ubuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Cwale twasa tatika uku litunta kame twebeni? Kampa twasa zunda aman’olo go bumpaki gaja kwenu kampa gazwa kwenu sinagwe bamwinya abantu ubu batendela? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Ninwe in’olo lyetu ili lin’ololitwe mu myojo jetu lizekelelwe no kubaligwa ku bantu bonse. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Mi mwasa bonaala buti ninwe n’olo lizwa kwa Kilesite, ili nalya letigwa ko musebezi gwetu, ili tali n’olitwe ko cin’oliso kono ko Moya gujoja gwa Nyambe, isini alukanko lwebwe, kono ulukanko lo myojo jo bantu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Mi tulikwesi nsepo ka Kilesite kwa Nyambe <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Ukuti iswe twenke tatugoli ukutenda icintu, kono ukugola kwetu kwa Nyambe kuzwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Mi neje uju atu golisa ukuba ababeleki bo busele ubuya, isini ko in’olo kono lyo Moya. Ukuti in’olo lyasa yaga, kono Umoya gwasawa ubumi.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Mi ati umusebezi ugu nagwa leta ulufwu, ulu nalwa zikigwa alukanko lwebwe, nalwe tuba, buti mane abantu ba Isilaele kaba kangwa ukulola ku nkumo ja Mushe kebaka lyo kukebela kakuli munkumo jakwe, mi kaku gola ukumana. <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Cwale insebelezo jo Moya taa naji kebele lwini no kuita? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Mi ati umusebezi ugu nagwa leta ukunyansigwa kagu kwesi ituba, cwale ni tuba lisika kwibo lyo musebezi ugu gulete ukucena! <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Ukuti ici kaci kwesi ituba etanzi, kuti naci bonaale ukubula ituba aa naci jelekezwe ne lelyo ituba ili li liita. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Ukuti ati ici kaci gola ukumana aa naca keza ne tuba, cwale ni tuba lisika kwibo nali beko kwa lelyo talimani!<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Mi kebaka lyo kuba no nsepo jo kukala bobo, takuli co kujoga. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Mi tatu likozite na Mushe, uju naga livwika isila ku nkumo, buti abana ba Isilaele baleke uku logolosa amamaninino go cintu kacimana. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Kono kaba kababubwiite mu nzunu jabo, ukuti ne shunwano aa ba bala mu busele bokale naba linunga bwa kunkulu kantnzi, kako kasindwe ko kasili ne shunwano, taa naka zwisigwa, mi kasindwe ka gola ku zwisigwa bulyo ka Kilesite. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Kono ne shunwano aa kubaligwa byo mulao gwa Mushe, akasindwe kasi vwikite imyojo jabo. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Kono umuntu aa sigulukila ku Mfumu, akasindwe kasa zwisigwa. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Cwale Umfumu ne Moya, mi aa kukele Umoya go Mfumu, ku likele intukuluo. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Cwale iswe twense tulola ituba lyo Mfumu natu livwikite ku nkumo, gasa tutenda wawa sinagwe neje, ubu tu kezela mu ciswaniso mwi tuba lingiiswa, ili lizwa ku Umfumu, uju ali Umoya.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ulubono lo Moya fulumikilwa mu kazunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Nangaceciba, ko cisemo ca Nyambe naga tuwa gogu umusebezi uku tenda, mi imyojo jetu taji zwafi. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Mi natwa kana ubuzinda no bitendantu bimangoju, tatu jendi ko magano amamangoju, tatu gwaniki ijwi lya Nyambe. Mi twasa gamba icote, mi mukutenda bobo twasa lipaka mu mutendelo umulotu ku bantu bonse abuso bwa Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Mi nanga Amajwi Malotu aga tuziga ga zinditwe, kwa babo aba bajunda. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Mi satani nyambe gwa ansi, naga zola inzunu ja babo tabazumini, mu kuba kanisa uku bona ituba lyo Majwi malotu, Ili libonisa ukubega kwa Kilesite, uju akele mu ciswaniso ca Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Ukuti ibi tutandaza tali niswe, kono ni Jesu Kilesite uju ali Mfumu, mi iswe ko kuba abaika benu ka Jesu bulyo. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Ukuti Nyambe uju naga gamba buti, “Muleke ituba limunike mwififi,” mi naga tenda ulumuni lwakwe ulu lutu munikila mu myojo jetu muku tuwa ulumuni lo nzunu lye tuba lya Nyambe, ili li munika mu nkumo ja Kilesite.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Kono tuli kwesi lolu ulubono mu tuzunga, buti jejo inguzu inene kwa Nyambe jizwa, mi tali kwetu jizwa. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Mi mu bukababu tu kele mu tuito tonse, kono tatu sininikizwi, mi tatu maninwi insepo, <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />tula pengisigwa, kono tatu futatilwi, tula umputigwa, kono tatu jundisigwi. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Mi inako jonse mu mibili jetu tuli indite ulufwu lwa Jesu, buti ubumi bwa Jesu nabo bu bikululwe mu mibili jetu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Ukuti iswe tujoja, inako jonse tula twaligwa ku lufwu ka Jesu bulyo, buti ubumi bwakwe nabo nabu bikululwe mu mibili jetu. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Cwale ulufwu lula beleka kwetu, mi ubumi bwasa beleka kwenu.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Kono ku lin’olitwe buti, “Nana zumina ukuti nana gamba.” Ukuti tuli kwesi umoya go kulikoza go ntumelo, mi kame natwa zumina mane tula gamba. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Mi tuli zekelele buti Nyambe uju naga busa Mfumu Jesu ku bafwu, kuti natu buse na Jesu no ku tugwanika nenwe kwakwe. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Mi ibintu byonse ninwe bitendelwa, buti icisemo ci sike ku bantu mu bungi wawa, mi naci lete uku litumela lwini, buti Nyambe na lumbekigwe.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujoja ke ntumelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Nangaceciba, tatuzwafi, nanga imibili jetu na jifwa, kono ubuntu bwetu bwa anze bula jonauka, kono ubuntu bwa mukati bula sensumunwa inako jonse. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Ukuti inkalilwa jetu niuba jo nakogana bulyo, mi kuti naga tuletele ituba inene likalilile ili liita gago amapenzi. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Cwale tatu lolele ibintu ibi tuwene, kono tuli lolele ibi tatuwene, mi ibi bibonigwa byasa kala inako imfuwi bulyo, kono ibi tabibonigwa bili kalilile.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Cwale tulizekelele buti ati injugo jetu ja ansi naji jundisigwa, tuli kwesi injugo jizwa kwa Nyambe, injugo iji ji kalilile ja kwigulu, iji taa naja jakigwa ko maganja go muntu. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Mi tatukele momo munjugo, tula shaka wawa ka kala mwi njugo jetu ja kwigulu, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />ukuti aa natu ka zwatikigwe, taa natu ka gwanaale mu cisense. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Ukuti iswe aa tusi kele mu njugo ja ansi, tula shugwiswa ukulema, ukuti tatu shaki ukuzuligwa, kono twasa shaka ukuzwata, buti ici cifwa ci minigwe ku bumi. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Mi uju naga tulomba ni Nyambe momu mumukalilo, uju naga tuwa Umoya go kufumbatila bulyo, kulindila ugu nagwize.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Mi cwale inako jonse tuli kwesi bundume, mi tuli zekelele buti nanga natukele ku munzi mu buntu, tuli kele kule no Mfumu. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Ukuti twasajoja ke ntumelo, isini mu kubona. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Mi tuli kwesi ubundume, mi ici tushaka wawa cakuleka umubili, no kakala ku munzi ne Mfumu. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Cwale nanga natu kele momu mu munzi kampa ukule, umugajalo gwetu gwa ku mujangaza. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Ukuti twense kuti natu ka bonaale acikalo co nkatulo ca Kilesite, buti umuntu gense naka tambule icintu icilotu kampa icimangoju ici naga tenda nasikele mu mubili.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubusele ne Nyambe ka Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Cwale tuli zekelele buti Umfumu ali jelele ukujogigwa, twasa indikiza bamwinya, mi tuli zekelelwe kwa Nyambe, mi nili sepite buti nenwe mu myojo jenu muli ni zekelele. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Mi tali kame tulitunta twebeni kono twasa miwa akaito ko kulitunta ketu, mi mugole ukutaba aba balitunta ko nsobozi, isini kweci cili mu mojo. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Mi ati nanga natu bulumukite, sinagwe bamwinya, ubu batyo kebaka lya Nyambe, mi nanga natu kwesi inzunu kebaka lyenu. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Ukuti twasa jendesigwa ko cisemo ca Kilesite, mi natwa atula buti umuntu genke naga fwila abantu bonse, mi bonse na bafwa. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Mi naga fwila abantu bonse, buti ababajoja baleke uku lijojele bonke, kono ba jojele uju naga fwila, mi kame naga buka.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Mi kuzwa aano, tatu atuli umuntu kuja kobu bamuindile mwilonga. Mi nanga mwi nako jimwinya Kilesite natwa muinda bobo, kono tatu sitendi bobo. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Nangaceciba, ati umuntu gense uju akele kwa Kilesite, gwa cibumbigwa iciya, icikulukulu nacamana, mi ibintu byonse nabya zoka ibiya. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Mi ibintu byonse kwa Nyambe bizwa, uju naga tukwatila kwakwe ka Kilesite, mi naga tuwa umusebezi go kukwatilana. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Ukuti Nyambe nagawa abantu be longa ka Kilesite, mi naga bogoza ilonga kwakwe, uku ta bogolekezi abantu amafosisa gabo, mi naga tula kwetu ijwi lyo kukwatilana. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Cwale mpaa tu gamba bya Kilesite, sinagwe buti Nyambe kame a lapela ketu, twasa kumbila kebaka lya Kilesite, mi mukwalane na Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Ukuti Nyambe naga bumba Kilesite uju taa naga tenda icibi, ukuba icitagilo co cibi cetu, buti tu tendigwa aba bacenite kwa Nyambe Kilesite.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Mi mukuba ababeleki ba Nyambe, twasa miindikiza muleke ukutambula inkumbu ja Nyambe mu mbwashula. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Ukuti Nyambe buti atyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">“Inako jangu aa naji keze jo kumi bonisa icisemo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">Nana mishugwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">Mi ijuba lyangu aa nalya sika lyo kujojesa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">Nana kutusa.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Cwale tegeleza! Mi jejino ne nako jo inkumbu ja Nyambe, kame ne nako jo kujojesigwa.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Mi tatu tulili umuntu icintu ci sitagalisa mu nzila, buti umusebezi gwetu gu leke uku nyansigwa. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Kono ko kuba abaika ba Nyambe, tuli pake twebeni mutuito tonse, kuzundamina lwini, mu mapenzi, mu makababu mane no munkalilwa. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />Mi natwa kabigwa, no kutuligwa mu muntolongo, no munkondo, mu kubeleka lwini, mu cikowaguzi mane no munjala. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Mu kucenisigwa, mu kushugwisisa, mu bugomba ne cisemo, ko Moya go Kucena, mane na ko cisemo ciitilile, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />ko kugamba icote, na ke nguzu ja Nyambe, mukukwata ibilwiso kwi ganja lyo mulyo ne lyo monsho. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Mi mukati ko ku kutikigwa no kushwauligwa, no ku gambigwa ubumangoju, no kulumbigwa. Nanga natu indigwa buti tuli baomi, kono tuli ba cote, <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />mi sinagwe aba taba zekelelwe, kono tuli zekelelwe wawa, twasa fwa, kono tula joja, tula kabigwa kono tatu yagigwa. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Mi imyojo jetu jili cokite, kono inako jonse tuli jangele, tuli bampale, kono twasawa ulubono abangi, tatu kwesi cimwinya, kono tuli kwesi ibintu byonse.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Cwale mwe Makolinte, natwa gamba bulukuluwite kwenu, mi imyojo jetu jili shumunukite kwenu. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Mi kulubazu lwetu tatu bulite icisemo, kono inwe tamu kwesi icisemo kwetu. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Mi mu kubogolekeze, mi nasa gamba nenwe sinagwe muli banangu. Cwale nenwe mu shumunune imyojo jenu kwetu.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukunanguzwa ko bantu tabazuminite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Cwale muleke ukulipana kwi jokwe lyonke no bantu tabazumini. Ukuti aba bacenite naba tabacenite mpacinzi ba gwananina? Kampa ituba ne fifi pacinzi bi gwananina? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Cwale Kilesite no Satani acinzi zuminana? Kampa umuntu uju azuminite acinzi ba gwananina noju ta zuminite? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Mi itempele ja Nyambe ajoja. Sinagwe Nyambe aa naga gamba buti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">“Kuti nani joje nabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">Mi nani jende nabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">Mi kuti nanibe Nyambe gwabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">Abo nababe abantu bangu.”<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Umfumu buti atyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">“Nangaceciba, muzwe kwabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">Mi mulitae nabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Muleke ukukwata icintu ce tukuta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">Mi kuti nani mitambule.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Mi kuti nanibe Senu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">Inwe namube banangu bo baninzana na bo bakazana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">Bobo atyo Nyambe Sakapanga.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Cwale bashakigwa, mi aa tukwesi inkuluwizi ja bobo, tuli cenese kwi tukuta lyonse lyo buntu no lyo moya, natu ligongweze mu kulicenesa kwetu natu jogite Nyambe.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukujangala kwa Paulusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Cwale mutu galwile imyojo jenu, taa natwa tenda umuntu ubumangoju, mi taa natwa jonena umuntu, kame takuli uju natwa tapa icintu cakwe. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Mi tani gambi bobo mu kuminyansa, sinagwe aa nana gamba ku matatikilo buti, Muli kele mu mojo gwangu, kujojela antuonke no kufwila nenwe. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Mi nana gamba kwenu bunyangulukite lwini, mi nasa litunta lwini. Cwale nasa gongozigwa wawa mu nkalilwa jetu, mi ukujangala kwangu mu mapenzi kunene lwini.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Kono nanga aa natwa sika mwa Masedoniya, taa natwa wisa, kono natwa gwana amakababu mu tuito tonse, kulwisigwa, mane no bujoge mu myojo jetu. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Kono Nyambe umugongozi gwaba bacokite imyojo, naga tugongoza ka Tite aa naga keza kusika. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Mi taa kakuli kwiza kwakwe bulyo, kono kame no kugongozwa uku nagwa muwa, aa naga tu gambaguza byo kulumbila kwenu, no nshoni jenu, no ciindikizi cenu kwangu, mi byebyo byonse nabya ni jangaza lwini. <verse eid="2CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Mi nanga aa nana migenisa ke n’olo ili nana mi n’olela, tani linyansi. Mi nana linyansa aa nana bona buti in’olo lyangu nalya mi kubaza, kono mwinako ifuwi bulyo. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Cwale nili jangele isini kebaka lyo kuti nana mi kubaza, kono kebaka lyo kuti namwa banga ku sigulukila kwa Nyambe, buti muleke ku fosekezwa kwa cimwinya ketu. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Ukuti inshoni ja Nyambe jasa leta ukubanga no kutwala ku kujojesa no kulinyansa, kono ukugenisigwa kwe longa kwasa twala ku lufwu. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Cwale nga mulole ukugenisigwa uku kuzwa kwa Nyambe ici nakwa leta kwenu, ukuligongoza kwenu, no ku ligambilila ko kukala buti, no kulinyansa ko kukala buti, no kujoga ko kukala buti, no kulukisa ko kukala buti? Ka byebyo byonse namwa tu bonisa buti taa kamu muli mu mukwa go kukala bobo.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Cwale nanga aa nana mi n’olela, taa kaguli umugajalo go muntu uju ala fosi, kampa umuntu uju naga penga ku bumangoju, kono ku bonaale kwenu impabalelo jenu kwetu abuso bwa Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Cwale natwa nyangululwa kwa byebi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Mi natwa gongozwa imyojo, kame natwa njangazwa lwini kebaka lyo kunjangala kwa Tite umoya gwakwe ubu nagwa nyangulwila inwe mwense. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Mi nana litunta kwakwe kenu, mi taa namwa ni fwisa inshoni. Kono sinagwe aa natwa gamba icote, ukulitunta kwetu ka Tite natwa gwana buti ni cote kame. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Mi icisemo cakwe kwenu cisili cinene lwini, aa mibuluka buti mwense namwa zumina, mi namwa mutambula ko bujoge ne kute. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Cwale nili jangele aa nigola bobo ukutula insepo ji itilile kwenu.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Ukuwa ko bazumini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Cwale bakwetu, twasa shaka buti muzekelele byo nkumbu ja Nyambe iji nagawa ku mankeleke ga mwa Masedoniya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />ukuti munkalilwa jo mujeleko gwenu, abazumini balikwesi ukujangala kunene, mi mu bumpale bunene bwabo, nabawa lwini. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Ukuti nasapaka buti nabawa kobu kabagolela, muku saindikizwa kuita ubu kaba golela ko mugajalo gwabo, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />ko kushaka kwabo, kuti naba zundamine uku kumbila buti tubawe akaito ko kutusa abazumini ba Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Mi naba tanta ubu katu gajile, ukuti naba tatika tansila ukutulitula bonse ku Mfumu, mi kame nakwetu ko mugajalo gwa Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Cwale natwa kumbila Tite, uju naga tatika gogu umusebezi go butokwa go nkumbu, mu kuguleta ku mamaninino. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Mi nanga natu ngiilwe ku bintu, mu ntumelo, mu kugamba, mu nzunu, mu kuligongoza, mane ne cisemo ici muziga kaco, mu bone buti kame mwasa ngiilwa ku nkumbu jo kuwa.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Cwale tani mi indikizi, kono nasa shaka ukujeleka ubunene bo cisemo cenu mu kucibambanya wawa neca bamwinya bantu. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Ukuti muli zekelele inkumbu jo Mfumwetu Jesu Kilesite, nanga aa kakwesi ulubono, kono kebaka lyenu nagaba umpale, ukuti mu bumpale bwakwe inwe mube no lubono.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Mi jeji ne nkatulo jangu kwebi bikele nenja kwenu mwa jeji intaba. Cwale mu mwaka nagwamana kamuli betanzi isini mukuwa bulyo kono no mu kulumbila ukutenda bobo. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Cwale mu maninine mu kutenda umusebezi, sinagwe aa namwa indikila mu ku gu tenda, namugaja ici mujelele ukuwa isini ici tamugoli. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Ukuti conse ici muwa cila tambulwa, ati umuntu naciwa ubu akwatile, isini ko muntu ubu takwatile. <verse eid="2CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Mi tani gambi buti bamwinya ba tusigwe mi bamwinya ba lemenwe, kono mujendelele. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Kono mwa jejino inako ibingi ibi mukwesi bituse aba tabakwesi mi ijona aa namubule, babo nabagole ukumitusa kwabyebyo nababe nabyo mi mukutenda bobo kuti nakulikoze kwabo nakwenu. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Sinagwe ubu kun’olelwe buti, “Umuntu uju naga gwanika mu bungi taa kakwesi lwini, mi uju naga gwanika mu buce taa kakwesi mu buce.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tite na basele bakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Cwale amalumbo gabe kwa Nyambe, uju nagawa Tite umojo go mpabalelo go kukoza ne gwangu ni kwesi kwenu. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Mi Tite naga tambula ikumbilo jangu nenja, mi nageza kwenu ko ku shaka kwakwe, no ciindikizi co mojo gwakwe. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Mi cwale kame twasa mutuma no mukwetu uju a lumbigwa lwini ku makeleke ko kutandaza Amajwi Maloto. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Mane naje natwa shalilwa ku mankeleke kutu sindikiza aa tukainda ibitagilo byo musebezi gogu buti tukutike Umfumu ije wawa, mi tu bonise icisemo cetu co kutusa. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Cwale twasa shaka ukuambuka buti tuleke kunyansigwa mu biwegwa binene ibi tujendesa. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Ukuti twasa ukutenda nenja, isini bulyo mu mensho go Mfumu, kono ne mu mensho go bantu.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Mi mukunungako, twasa batuma no mukwetu uju ajelele kutenda nenja ibintu mi kuti nalikataze lwini nokuita ukuti ali misepite lwini. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Cwale Tite, musele gwangu kame mutusi gwangu kwenu, mi cwale abakwetu batumigwa bo mankeleke, mi ni tuba lya Kilesite. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Mi cwale muba bonise buti mula bashaka mi ama nkeleke gazumine mwa jejo intaba ga zekelele buti kulikele nenja aa tulitunta kenu.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Ukutusa abazumini babulite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Cwale takuli intuso jo ku min’olela byo citagilo ciwegwa kwa bana Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Ukuti nili zekelele buti mula shaka lwini ukutusa, mi nana litunta kenu ku bantu ba mwa Masedoniya aa nana tyo buti, “Kuzwa mwakwali abantu ba mwa Akaya naba litukiseza ukuwa, mi iciindikizi cabo naca indikiza ubungi bo bantu. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Kono nasa tuma bakwangu buti ukulitunta kwetu kenu, kuleke ukufosaala mwa jejo intaba, kono namu gwanigwe namu litukiseze, sinagwe ubu nana gambila. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Cwale ati abantu bazwa kwa Masedoniya na beeza neme mi kumigwana namusini uku litukiseza, tatugoli uku gamba cimwinya kenu, kuti natube ne nshoni lwini, kebaka leci natwa litunta kaco. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Cwale nasa gaja buti kulikele nenja ukuindikiza bakwetu mukuwelangila ukumipotela muku maninisa ukulitukiseza ko ciwegwa icinene ici namwa kuluwizwa. Cwale kuti nacibe iciwegwa icinene.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Cwale muli jelele ukubuluka buti, umuntu gense uju amwaga mubuce kuti na zimbule mu buce, mi uju abyala lwini kuti na zimbule lwini. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Mi umuntu gense awe ubu agajile mu mojo gwakwe, isini ko mpilaelo kampa ko kuindikizwa, kono Nyambe gasa shaka umuntu uju awa bujangele. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Mi Nyambe ala gola ukumi fwijagula mubunene, buti inako jonse mugwane mubungi ibi mushaka, mi ka byebyo mugole imisebezi imilotu jonse. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Sinagwe ubu kun’olelwe buti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">“Bulyo naga mwaga ibiwegwa ku bampale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">Buti ukucena kwabo na ku kalilile.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Mi uju awa imbuto ku mubyali ne cilyo co cinkwa, kame neje na miwe no ku mingiisiza imbuto iji mushaka, mi kuti nangiise nebi muzimbula byenu byo kucena. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Mi kuti na mube no lubono lwini mutuito tonse, buti na mugole ukuwa inako jonse, buti ketu ukuwa kwenu naku bonaale mukuwa amalumbo kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Ukuti jeji insebelezo mutenda, taji tendelwi bulyo abantu ba Nyambe, kono jasa ngiisa ku malumbo ga tendelwa Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Ukuti kajeji insebelezo iji namwa lipaka mwebeni, mi bamwinya kuti balumbe Nyambe muku sepaala uku kutwala kuku ligambilila ku Majwi Malotu ga Kilesite, mi mukulitaila nabo naba mwinya bonse. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Mi ko mantapelo gabo kwenu, mi kuti naba milapelele ko cisemo icinene kebaka lye nkumbu jiitilile iji nagamiwa Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Mi amalumbo ga wegwe kwa Nyambe ko ciwegwa tacitegwa cakwe!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa ligambilila ka byo musebezi gwakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Cwale ime ne Paulusi nasa kumbila ko cisemo ne mojo gonse gwa Kelesite, uju ategwa buti nili muntu ali tula kwinsi aa ni kele mukati kenu, kono aa ni kele kule nenwe nili mushanshu. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Mi nasa mi kumbila buti aa nani keze kwenu, nani leke ukuba umushanshu kubantu aba bagaja buti balajoja ko mukalilo gwa lelino ilonga. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Ukuti nanga natu joja ke longa, tatu lwi inkondo je longa. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Mi ibilwiso tu lwisa tali be longa, kono bili kwesi inguzu ka Nyambe mu kugwisa ulubaga. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Mi twasa manisa inkokani iji ji litunta muku lwisa inzunu ja Nyambe, mi twasa shumina imigajalo jonse buti ji zumine Kilesite. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Cwale tuli li litukiseze ukubangisa gense uju ta zumini, mi ukuzumina kwenu aa nakutendaale.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Cwale mwasaatula kobu muwenene. Ati bamwinya balikwesi insepo buti kwa Kilesite bwa gwanaala, balijelele ukugaja kame buti neswe tula gwanaala kwa Kilesite sinagwe nabo ubu batendele. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Cwale nanga ati nani litunta kuitilila kenguzu iji naga tuwa Umfumu jo kumijakisa, isini jo kumiseleza ansi, mi taa jini fwise inshoni. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Mi tanishaki kumibonisa sinagwe kame nijeleka kumijogisa ko man’olo gangu. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Mi sinagwe bamwinya ubu batyo buti, “Aman’olo gakwe ga kulema no ciindikizi, kono aa kele mukati ketu ko buntu muuba, mi amajwi gakwe ga mbwashula.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Cwale abantu bo kukala bobo balijelele ukuzekelela buti ubu tukalile mu man’olo getu aa tatukuli, kuti natube mubitendantu bwetu aa natukale nenwe.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Mi tatushaki ukuli bambanisa nababo bamwinya aba baliwite. Cwale aa balibambanisa abo beni kabo beni no kuli bambanya abo beni kabo beni, tabakwesi nzunu. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Micwale taa natulitunte lwini kuitilila, kono kuti natu litunte mukati ko maninja go misebezi ja Nyambe ije wawa natwa wegwa kwakwe, amaninja kame aga gaindilila nenwe. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Mi tatuji kule wawa mukulitunta kwetu, sinagwe ubu kukalile ati tatulakezi kwenu sinagwe ubu namwa gwanina lwini ne Majwi Malotu ga Kilesite. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Cwale tatulitunti lwini kuitilila ko misebezi iji nabatenda bamwinya, mi insepo jetu ja buti, intumelo jenu jiekeza mukukula, mi imisebezi jetu mukati kenu kuti naji janduluke lwini, <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />buti natu gole ukutandaza Amajwi Malotu mubilanda bikele kwisilya lyenu. Ukuti tatushaki ukulitunta ko musebezi ugu nagwa tendaala kale mucibaka ca jumwinya.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Kono buti kutyo, “Muleke uju alitunta, alitunte mu Mfumu.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Ukuti umuntu uju azuminizwa talipaki jemwini kono gasa pakigwa ku Mfumu.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Paulusi no batumigwa bomanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Cwale muni tegeleze, nili kwesi insepo buti kuti mujendelele neme mu bugelo bwangu! <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Ukuti umuna ugu akwesi Nyambe, neme go muna ni kwesi kwenu, nana mi gungilikiza ku musesi genke Kilesite, buti na mube sinagwe mwalyansho go kucena kwakwe. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Kono nili kwesi bujoge, sinagwe ijoka aa nalya omenena Eva ko butali bwalyo, imigajalo jenu bunga kuti naji ambuke kuzwa ku kuumpilila Kilesite. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Ukuti mwasa zuminina bwangu umuntu jumwinya aa keza ku mi kutandza Jesu jumwinya, isini Jesu uju natwa miziga, kampa mwasa tambula umoya gumwinya, Umoya ugu tagu likozite ne Majwi Malotu aga namwa tambula kwetu.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Mi tani gaji buti nili go mamaninino kwa babo “abatumigwa” benu aba muinda buti ba butokwa. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Cwale nanga tani zekelele nenja ukugamba, kono nili kwesi nzunu. Mi nakwa bonaala bobo ku bantu bonse mu bintu byonse.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Cwale kagali mafosisa aa nana litula kwinsi kwenu no ku mukutika mu kutandaza Amajwi Amalotu ga Nyambe kwenu uku takuli ici namwa niwa? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Nana shonga amankeleke gamwinya mu kutambula ibiwegwa byago buti nimi belekele. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Mi aa kani sikele nenwe, kani zunda cimwinya, mi taa nana lemeza umuntu ukuti abakwangu aba kabazwa kwa Masedoniya, aba naba niletela ibi kani shaka. Cwale kuti ni tokomele buti ni leke uku mi lemeza, mi kuti nani indikile ukutende bobo. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Mi sinagwe ni cote ja Kilesite aa ji kele kwangu, nana ligongoza takuli uju nani tape, kebaka lyo kulitunta ka jejo intaba mu bilalanda byonse bya Akaya. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Cwale nasa gamba bobo ukuti tani mishaki? Nyambe ali zekelele buti nila mi shaka!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Mi ici nitenda kuti nani citende, ukuti aba bazunda ibaka nili babulise lyo kuti ici balitunta kaco na bagwane buti ba li likozite neswe. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Cwale abantu bo kukala bobo batumigwa bomanya, basa sebeza ko magano mamangoju, basa litenda sinagwe batumigwa wawa ba Kilesite. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Mi taku komokisi, ukuti naje Satani gasa lizola sinagwe ni ngiloi lye tuba. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Cwale taku komokisi, ati abaika bakwe aa bali zola sinagwe bakucena. Mi amamaninino gabo kuti nagabe sinagwe misebezi jabo.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amapezi ga Paulusi ko kuba mutumigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Mi kame nasa gamba buti, umuntu aleke ukugaja buti nili cigangantu. Kono nanga na mugaja bobo, muni tambule nanga nanili cigangantu, buti neme nani litunte mubuce. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Cwale ibi ni gamba tani bigambi sinagwe ni Mfumu, kono ko bugangantu, ka bobu bundume ni litunta. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Ukuti abantu bangi basa litunta ke bintu bye longa, neme kuti nani litunte. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Cwale mwasa jangala lwini aa mugwanana no bigelo, kono namukwesi inzunu. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Mi mula lekelela umuntu ukumizola ubuika, nanga na milyila kampa ukumitapa byenu, kampa uku milyatilila, kampa ku mikaba maaka ku nkumo. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Mi nasa gamba ke nshoni, sinagwe natwa tenda ko kubula inguzu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Kono ati umuntu jumwinya na litunta mu cintu, nasa gamba sinagwe cigangantu, neme nilijelele ukulitunte. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Cwale tali Maebelu? Neme nili Muebelu. Cwale tali Maisilaele? Neme nili Muisilaele. Cwale ba mukoga gwa Abbulaama? Neme nili go mukoga gwa Abbulaama. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Cwale baika ba Kilesite? Nasa gamba sinagwe muntu go kubulumuka, kono nana mubelekela ku baita wawa, ku tuligwa mu Ntolongo inako jonse, no ku kabigwa lwini, mi inako jonse kani shakanga ukufwu. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Mu mitendelo ja tosanwe, nana tambula amapafa go makumi gotatwe natosanwe nagone (39) ku Majuda. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Mi nana shapigwa ampafa ko tatwe, no pobaguligwa ko mabwe. Mi nana fwilwa ku bwato ko tatwe, mi no kulishala akamwi no masiku amushanja gwe wate. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Mi nanaba mu mijendo imingi, nana gwana bukababu mu lwizi, no bukababu ku basa, no bukababu ku bakwangu, no bukababu ku bantu tabali Majuda, no bukababu mu minzi, no bukababu mu mangusu, no bukababu mu mawate, mane no bukababu ku bazumini bomanya. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Mi nana sebeza wawa mane kusebeza imisebezi mikababu, no kuba no cikowaguzi, mu kufwa injala ne nyotwa, mu kubula ibilyo, mu kufwa impeyo no kukala mu cisense. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Mi kuzwa kwa byebi ibintu byonse, ko guli umuzigo guni kezela mwi juba go kubabalela amankeleke gonse. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Cwale nini uju akotele, ime aa tani koteli? Mi nini agwila mu cibi, mi neme tani jakili mu cizuba?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Mi ati nili jelele ukulitunta, kuti nilitunte ko buntu bi bonisa kufokola kwangu. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Mi Nyambe, Isi gwa Mfumu Jesu, uju awegwa amalumbo inako jonse, ali zekelele buti tani omi. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Mi aa kanili mwa Damaseka, umubusisi jendesigwa ku mfumu Aletasi naga tula abalindili abinzi byo munzi buti bani shumine. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Kono naba ni tula mu citundu no kuni sezumukisiza mukaompo ko lubaga mi kale naanda mu maganja gakwe.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Impono no magano ga Paulusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Mi nili jelele ukulitunta, nanga takuli ici ni jelele ukugwana, kuti ni gambe byo mampono no magano naga niwa Umfumu <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Cwale nili zekelele umuntu ka Kilesite, uju naga kwatigwa mwtatu lye kwigulu mu myaka jo jekumi najone (14) ga kwishule. Mi tani zekelele buti nakwa tendaala bobo, kampa kajili impono, ni Nyambe bulyo uju azekelele. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Mi nili zekelele buti joju umuntu naga indilwa mu mubili kampa ko kuleka umubili, tani zekelele, kono uju azekelele, ni Nyambe. <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Mi joju umuntu naga indilwa mu Paladaisi, mi naga kashugwa ibintu tabigolwi ukutansululwa, ibi tabi zuminizwa umuntu ukubigamba. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Mi kuti ni litunte ko muntu go kukoza sinagwe jojo, kono ime tani litunte kangu, bwita ko bintu bi bonisa ukufokola kwangu. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Nanga ati kani shaka ukulitunta, taa kani jelele ukuba icigangantu, ukuti kani jelele ukugamba icote. Kono taa kani gola ukutenda bobo, cwale takuli uju kagola uku gajikiza umugajalo kuita ubu aniwenele kampa ubu ani shugwile.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Cwale nileke ukulitunta kebi nana bikulwilwa, nana wegwa imiga mu mubili, mutumigwa gwa Satani keza kuni lwisa. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Mi kajejo intaba nana kumbila ko tatwe ku Mfumu buti ceco cintu ci indigwe kwangu. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Kono Umfumu naga gamba kwangu buti, “Inkumbu jangu jili kujelele, ukuti inguzu jangu ninene mukufokola.” Cwale kuti nani litunte lwini bujangele ko bufokoli bwangu, buti inguzu ja Kilesite naji kale kwangu <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Mi kebaka lya Kilesite, nili nyangulukite aa nifokola, mukutukigwa, mukubula, mukupengisigwa, mane no mumakababu. Ukuti aa ni kotela nasa gongola.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulusi aa bilaezwa byo Makolinte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Cwale nanaba icigangantu, ukuti namwa ni indikiza kutenda bobo. Mi kamu jelele uku nipaka, ukuti mu bintu byonse tani itigwi ku batumigwa banene, nanga aa tani indigwa ubutokwa. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Mi nanagola ukutenda umusebezi mukati kenu go mutumigwa gwa cote, ko bibonantu, kobibilimisi, na komamakazo. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Cwale buti namwa namwabila kuita amankeleke gamwinya, bunga taa nana miwa umuzigo go kulema? Muni kwatile mu mafosisa gaga.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Cwale nilijelele ukwiza kwenu mwinako jatatu, mi taa nanibe umuzigo go kulema kwenu, ukuti tani shaki ulubono lwenu, kono ninwe ni shaka. Mi tali banuke bagola ubikila abazazi, kono abazazi babo babikila abanuke <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Cwale nilijangele ukumiwa ibintu byonse ibi nikwesi, mi no kulijandulula nemwini. Nanga nani mishaka wawa, inwe tamu nishaki lwini?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Kono kuti na muzumine buti taa nana miwa umuzigo go kulema. Kono nana mi zwakeza mu nzunu ko kumioma. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Cwale nana miomenena ko bantu nanatuma kwenu? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Mi nana kumbila Tite keza kwenu, mi no kumutuma na mukwetu. Cwale Tite naga miomenena? Mi taa natwa jenda mu mwanza go moya go kulikoza?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Mi bunga kamu gaja buti twasa ligambilila iswe twebeni kwenu? Twasa gamba byonse abuso bwa Nyambe, sinagwe babo balimu Kilesite, mi ibintu byonse tu tenda basele bangu bya ku migongoza. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Ukuti nili jogete buti aa nani keze kusika koko, nani migwane ubu nishakila buti mukalile. Mi nasa joga bunga kuti nakube ne nkonkani, no muna, no bunyegezi, no inkole, no busebe, no kulitunta, no kusa jendelela mu nzunu. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Mi nili jogete buti aa nani keze kame kwenu, Nyambe gwangu kuti nani seleze abuso bwenu, ukuti abantu bangi naba tenda icibi, mi taa naba banga mwitukuta lyabo, ne cise cabo, no mu kulumbila kwabo ukumangoju.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Kunanguzwa ko mamaninino no mandagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Mi jeji kuti najibe inako jatatu ukwiza kwenu. “Mi intaba jonse kuti ji gongole aa ji gambigwa ku bampaki bobile kampa botatwe.” <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Cwale nana nanguza abantu naba tenda icibi aa kanikele nenwe mu lujendo lwabili. Kono nisi gamba kame nanga tani keleko, aa nani kabogole taa nani fwile inse babo naba tenda icibi ku matatikilo kampa ne bamwinya bonse. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Mi kuti nani miwe icote iji mushaka buti Kilesite gasa gamba kangu. Mi tali muuba muku mibelekisa, kono ali kwesi inguzu mukati kenu. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Cwale kokuba nensepo, naga kankaminwa bufokolite, kono gasa joja kenguza Nyambe. Mumukwa go kulikoza, tulifokwele mwakwe kono kenguzu ja Nyambe kuti natujoje naje mukubeleka kwetu nenwe.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Cwale muli nangule mwebeni ati intumelo jenu jila joja, muli jeleke mwebeni. Cwale muli zekelele buti Kilesite Jesu mwali mukati kenu? Bunga namwa kangwa uku jelekigwa. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Mi nili sepite buti taa natwa kangwa umujeleko. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Cwale twasa kumbila kwa Nyambe buti namuleke ukutenda ubumangoju, isini buti abantu naba bone buti namwazimana mukujelekigwa, kono namutende ici cikele nenja nanga natubonaala buti natwa kangwa. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Ukuti tatugoli ukutenda cimwinya cilwisa icote, kono bwita cocote bulyo. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Mi twasa jangala aa tufokola, kono muli bagongo, mi inkumbilo jetu ja buti mulijelele uku bogolekezwa mubunene. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Mi mpaa n’ola byebi ibintu aa tanikuli, buti aa nanikeze nanileke ukuba no bushanshu mukulitusisa inguzu, inguzu iji naganiwa Umfumu mukujaka wawa isini mukumiseleza ansi.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Cwale bakwangu mukumaninina, mujangale! Muzunde byo kulibogolekeza, mugongozane, mube munzunu jonke, mujoje munkozo. Mi Nyambe go cisemo nenkozo kuti nabe nenwe.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Mi mulizenguze mukulisonsona kucenite.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Mi inkumbu jo Mfumu Jesu Kilesite nako cisemo ca Nyambe, na mukugwanana ko Moya go Kucena gube nenwe mwense.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>